.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-019-parallel-multiple-goals.md:33:The current extension intentionally supports one branch-local goal. Larger workflows need multiple independent top-level goals: release checklist items, parallel investigation paths, implementation shards, or external worktree sessions. This cannot be bolted onto the single `GoalState` casually because state, UI, continuation, budgets, proofs, and worktree/session ownership become multi-tenant.
