.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:114:## Implementation checklist
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:116:- [ ] Add idle policy types and bounded parsing helpers in `.pi/extensions/goal/types.ts` / state helpers.
