.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:118:- [ ] Normalize policy fields during replay in `.pi/extensions/goal/state.ts`; do not rely on broad spread for idle policy fields.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:119:- [ ] Extend `.pi/extensions/goal/continuation.ts` with delayed idle-nudge timer management and cancellation.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:120:- [ ] Suppress immediate `agent_end` continuation for `idle_nudge` and `manual` modes.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:121:- [ ] Add stale guards for delayed nudges: goal id, status active, unchanged policy, idle context, no pending messages.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:124:- [ ] Ensure safety/no-progress telemetry does not punish intentionally idle waits.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:132:- Existing goals without policy fields behave exactly like current immediate continuation goals.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:133:- An `idle_nudge` goal does not schedule the immediate 25ms follow-up at `agent_end`.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:134:- An `idle_nudge` goal schedules one delayed nudge after the configured/default interval.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:135:- Delayed nudges are stale-guarded and do not fire after pause, completion, clear, replacement, pending messages, or non-idle context.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:136:- `manual` mode schedules no automatic continuation and no delayed nudge.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-016-goal-idle-tolerant-mode.md:139:- Safety counters/no-progress handling does not classify intentional idle waiting as a no-progress loop.
